# ---- Trained artifacts ------------------------------------------------------
# The models/*.joblib files ARE committed on purpose. Streamlit Community Cloud
# only runs `streamlit run app/app.py`; it never runs `python train.py`, so the
# serialised pipeline has to be in the repo or the deployed app has no model.
# They total ~5.7 MB, well inside GitHub's limits. Regenerate with:
#     python train.py

